    <briefdescription>
<para>gRPC Server for handling inter-shard RPC requests </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>v1.3.4: Added for multi-node cluster deployments Handles incoming RPC requests from other shards:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Distributed transactions (2PC: prepare, commit, abort)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Data replication</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Health checks </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
